<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Stocks year shr down, div drops.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Stocks year shr down, div drops.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended April 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 69.0	  vs 49.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 10.0	  vs 15.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts polled by Reuters forecast Stocks' earnings per share falling to between 57.0 and 63.0 cents a share with consensus at 61.0 cents. They expected the dividend in a range of 11.0 to 15.0 cents with consensus at 14.0 cents.  </p>
